        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo ndāvye mbona mw ijuru urugi rwuguruye, kandi rya jwi nabanje kwumva rivugana nanje ari nk’iry’ inzamba, rirambgira, riti Dūga uze hano, nkwereke ibikwiye kuzobaho hanyuma y’ivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
