        {
          "text": "Iyo ntebe yar’ ikikijwe n’izindi ntebe mirongwibiri na zine: kur’ izo ntebe mbona abakuru mirongwibiri na bane bazicayeko, bambaye impuzu zera, no mu mitwe yabo har’ ibitsibo vy’izahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
