        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ imbere y’iyo ntebe hari nk’ikiyaga c’ibirahuri, gisa n’urubona: kandi hagati ahahanganye n’iyo ntebe no kuyikikuza har’ ibinyabugingo bine vyuzuye amaso imbere n’inyuma. ",
